WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.577 line:12% align:center
The tide is out!

00:00:01.677 --> 00:00:04.331 line:12% align:center
Grab everything that glitters

00:00:04.431 --> 00:00:05.941 line:12% align:center
A full bag slows you down

00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:08.894 line:12% align:center
Just one more…?

00:00:08.994 --> 00:00:12.041 line:12% align:center
Tide's coming. Run!

00:00:12.191 --> 00:00:14.841 line:12% align:center
Phew, made it!

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:19.891 line:12% align:center
Build with what you bring back

00:00:20.091 --> 00:00:22.941 line:12% align:center
Reach places you couldn't before

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:24.591 line:12% align:center
Until the empty island is a village

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.141 line:12% align:center
Low Tide Island — One thumb. Back before the tide.
